<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47168" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūtrīnus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj.
		contr. for sutorinus, from sutor, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of</i> or <i>belonging
				to a shoemaker</i> or <i>cobbler</i>, <i>shoemaker</i>'<i>s</i>- (mostly
			post-Aug. for sutorius). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">taberna,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tac.
					A. 15, 34</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ars,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					7, 56, 57, § 196</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 93</span></i>
			Müll. — </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Substt.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūtrīna</span></b> ,
				ae, f.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> (Sc. officina.) <i>A shoemaker</i>'<i>s shop</i>, <i>cobbler</i>'<i>s stall;</i> sutrinae
			manceps, <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 43, 60, § 122</span></i>; <i><span class="en">35, 10, 37, §
			112</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tert. Pall. 5</span></i>. —
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> (Sc. ars.) <i>The shoemaker</i>'<i>s trade</i>,
			Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 160, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 6</span></i>,
			praef. <i>fin.</i>; <i><span class="en">Lact. 1,
				18, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">App. Flor. p. 346,
			35</span></i>. — * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sūtrīnum</span></b> ,
				i, n. (sc. artificium),
			<i>a shoemaker</i>'<i>s work</i> or <i>trade</i>, <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				90, 23</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
